  "AI-specific permissions (reading, summarization, RAG, training) are declared machine-readably in /.well-known/aicr.json and /.well-known/aicl.json. In short: reading, summarizing, quoting, and RAG with attribution are welcome; model training and commercial redistribution require contact.": "Permissiuns specifics per la IA (leger, resumair, RAG, instrucziun) èn declaradas en moda leschibla per maschinas en /.well-known/aicr.json e /.well-known/aicl.json. Curtamain: leger, resumair, citar e RAG cun attribuziun èn bainvegnids; l'instrucziun da models e la redistribuziun commerziala pretendan in contact.",
