  "AICL generator": "AICL generator",
  "AICL is a protocol proposal — it does not guarantee that AI companies will pay.": "L'AICL è ina proposta da protocol — ella na garantescha betg che las interpresas da IA paian.",
  "AICL is the licensing and transaction layer built on top of AICR. Where AICR declares what is allowed, AICL defines how permission is actually obtained: license tiers and prices, quote and payment endpoints, signed license tokens, usage and audit logs, and revocation. It is designed to interoperate with emerging machine-payment mechanisms such as HTTP 402 flows and pay-per-crawl schemes, with agentic payment kept inside human-approved budgets and audit trails.": "L'AICL è il nivel da licenziaziun e da transacziun construì sur l'AICR. Nua che l'AICR declera tge che è lubì, definescha l'AICL co la permissiun vegn effectivamain obtegnida: categorias da licenza e pretschs, endpoints per offertas e pagaments, tokens da licenza suttascrits, protocols dad utilisaziun e da revisiun, sco er la revocaziun. Ella è concepida per interagir cun mecanissems da pagament automatisads emergents sco process HTTP 402 e schemas pay-per-crawl, cun il pagament agentic tegnì entaifer budgets approvads d'umans e protocols da revisiun.",
