  "AICR / AICL as an AI Content Licensing and Agentic Payment Connection Layer": "AICR / AICL as an AI Content Licensing and Agentic Payment Connection Layer",
  "AICR JSON Schema": "JSON Schema da l'AICR",
  "AICR declares what AI systems may do with content — reading, summarization, transformation, RAG, training, commercial use, redistribution, attribution. AICL converts those rights into executable flows: authorization, payment, credentials, usage logs, and revocation. Rather than forcing a binary between total prohibition and free extraction, AICR/AICL enables tiered licensing markets, interoperating with emerging machine-payment mechanisms (HTTP 402, pay-per-crawl) while keeping agentic payment inside human-approved budgets and audit trails.": "L'AICR declera tge che sistems da IA han lubientscha da far cun cuntegn — leger, resumair, transformar, RAG, instruir, utilisar commerzialmain, redistribuir, attribuir. L'AICL transferescha quests dretgs en process exequibels: autorisaziun, pagament, credenzials, protocols dad utilisaziun e revocaziun. Empè da sfurzar ina scelta binara tranter scumond total ed extracziun libra, permetta AICR/AICL martgads da licenziaziun graduads, en interacziun cun mecanissems da pagament automatisads emergents (HTTP 402, pay-per-crawl), tegnend il pagament agentic entaifer budgets approvads d'umans e protocols da revisiun.",
  "AICR generator": "AICR generator",
  "AICR is a declaration, not an enforcement mechanism — compliance depends on AI systems choosing (or being required) to honor it.": "L'AICR è ina decleraziun, betg in mecanissem dad execuziun — la conformità dependa dal fatg che sistems da IA la respectan (u vegnan obligads da la respectar).",
  "AICR is a machine-readable rights declaration layer. It lets a publisher state — per site, per path, or per resource — whether AI systems may read, summarize, quote, retrieve (RAG), transform, train on, commercially use, or redistribute content, and under which conditions such as attribution, retention limits, or contact-based licensing. Where robots.txt only says \"crawl or don't\", AICR carries the semantics of rights.": "L'AICR è in nivel leschibel per maschinas per declarar dretgs. El permetta ad in editur da definir — per website, per chalada u per resursa — sche sistems da IA han lubientscha da leger, resumair, citar, retrair (RAG), transformar, duvrar per instrucziun, utilisar commerzialmain u redistribuir cuntegn, e sut tge cundiziuns, sco attribuziun, limits da retenziun u licenziaziun basada sin contact. Nua che robots.txt di mo «cular u betg», porta l'AICR la semantica dals dretgs.",
