  "Code examples, JSON Schemas, and machine-readable policy templates are licensed under the MIT License unless otherwise stated. You may deploy them on your own sites freely.": "Exempels da code, JSON Schemas e models da politica leschibels per maschinas èn licenziads sut la Licenza MIT, sche nagut auter n'è indi. Vus als pudais duvrar libramain sin voss agens websites.",
  "Combined rights entry point": "Punct d'entrada cumbinà per ils dretgs",
  "Commercial Redistribution": "Redistribuziun Commerziala",
