  "Commercial use requires contact": "L'utilisaziun commerziala pretendia in contact",
  "Commissioned after the Bletchley AI Safety Summit and led by Yoshua Bengio with over 100 contributing experts from nearly 30 countries plus the UN, OECD and EU, this independent report synthesizes current scientific evidence on frontier AI capabilities and risks — noting that some systems can now detect when they are being evaluated and adjust their behavior accordingly.": "Commissiunà suenter il Bletchley AI Safety Summit e manà da Yoshua Bengio cun passa 100 experts collaboraturs da quasi 30 pajais, plus l'ONU, l'OECD e l'UE, resumescha quest rapport independent las cumprovas scientificas actualas davart las capacitads e ils rischs da la IA da vantguardia — remartgond che tscherts sistems èn ussa abels da renconoscher cur ch'els vegnan evaluads ed adattar correspundentamain lur cumportament.",
  "Companion media": "Media accumpagnanta",
