  "Correct positioning: independent research drafts, protocol proposals, and an open specification experiment.": "Posiziunament correct: projects da retschertga independents, propostas da protocol, ed in experiment avert da specificaziun.",
  "Corrected an earlier default: Belgium (BE) now maps to Dutch instead of French — Flemish speakers are the country’s majority (~60%) over Walloon French speakers (~40%).": "Correctà ina configuraziun predefinida pli veglia: la Belgia (BE) vegn ussa attribuida al nederlandais empè dal franzos — ils parladurs flamands furman la maioritad dal pajais (~60%) envers ils parladurs franzos walluns (~40%).",
  "Corrected an earlier default: Kazakhstan (KZ) now maps to Kazakh instead of Russian, now that a Kazakh translation exists — the same kind of fix as the earlier Belgium correction.": "Correctà ina configuraziun predefinida pli veglia: il Kazakstan (KZ) vegn ussa attribuì al kazak empè dal rus, cunquai ch'i exista ussa ina translaziun kazaka — il medem gener da correcziun sco quella pli baud per la Belgia.",
  "Could AI Be Conscious?": "Could AI Be Conscious?",
