  "Custom tier": "Nivel persunalisà",
  "Daily Nous reports on a retracted Journal of Medical Ethics submission containing multiple fabricated, AI-hallucinated references — complete with fake university affiliations and defunct email addresses — that the author reportedly left uncorrected even after being given a chance to fix proofs. The piece contrasts this with Bioethics, whose automated reference-checking would have caught the problem, and argues the real bottleneck isn't detection technology (one commenter's script flagged the fake citations in under a minute) but unpaid reviewer labor and publishing incentives that reward throughput over scrutiny.": "Daily Nous rapporta davart in artitgel retratg dal Journal of Medical Ethics che cuntegneva plirs renviaments fabritgads e «allucinads» da la IA — cumplettads cun affiliaziuns universitaras fictivas ed adressas dad e-mail betg pli existentas — ch'il autur avess, sco rapportà, laschà betg corrigì eir suenter avair survegnì la pussaivladad da corrigir las provas. L'artitgel cumpara quai cun Bioethics, la controlla automatisada da renviaments dal qual avess scuvert il problem, ed argumentescha che l'engulà genuin n'è betg la tecnologia da renconoscher (il script d'in commentader ha identifitgà las citaziuns fictivas en main d'ina minuta), mabain la lavur betg pajada dals revisurs e las incentivas da publicaziun che premian il rendiment envers il rigur.",
  "Data free-riding vs. trillion-dollar AI valuations": "Utilisaziun gratuita da datas cunter valitaziuns da la IA en bilíuns",
  "DeepMind CEO calls for an independent standards body to regulate frontier AI": "DeepMind CEO calls for an independent standards body to regulate frontier AI",
  "Demis Hassabis proposed a FINRA-style regulator for frontier model releases: labs would submit models for review up to 30 days before deployment, voluntary at first, with a path toward mandatory compliance in the US market.": "Demis Hassabis ha proponì in organissem regulatur en il stil da la FINRA per la publicaziun da models da vantguardia: ils laboratoris avessan da suttametter models per revisiun enfin 30 dis avant l'installaziun, dapprima sin basa voluntara, cun ina via envers ina conformità obligatorica sin il martgà da las Stadis Unids.",
  "Denied": "Refusà",
  "Deployable policy starter template": "Model da partenza da politica prontà per l'installaziun",
  "Deployable policy starter template at /downloads/agiright-policy-starter.zip — a minimal static site with the full machine-readable layer, ready for Cloudflare Pages or any static host.": "Model da partenza da politica prontà per l'installaziun sut /downloads/agiright-policy-starter.zip — in website static minimal cun il nivel cumplet leschibel per maschinas, pront per Cloudflare Pages u insaquala hosting static.",
  "Deploying machine-readable policies on your site": "Installar politicas leschiblas per maschinas sin voss website",
  "Disclaimer": "Renunzia da responsabilitad",
  "Distinct from human UI, SEO, or plain APIs, the AI Ingestion & Capability Layer gives websites a machine-facing architecture: a Manifest Layer (entry points like /llms.txt and /ai/manifest.json), a Corpus Layer (machine-readable knowledge), a Capability Layer (agent-callable tools), and a Governance Layer (provenance, licensing, versioning). Static-first, upgradeable toward APIs and MCP. Note: in this paper AICL names the ingestion architecture; on this site's protocol pages AICL refers to the AI Content Licensing Layer.": "A differenza dad ina interfatscha per umans, dal SEO u da simpels APIs, dat l'AI Ingestion & Capability Layer als websites in'architectura orientada vers maschinas: in nivel da manifest (puncts d'entrada sco /llms.txt e /ai/manifest.json), in nivel da corpus (savair leschibel per maschinas), in nivel da capacità (utensils clamabels dad agents), ed in nivel da governanza (provenienza, licenziaziun, versiunament). Prioritariamain static, extensibel envers APIs e MCP. Remartga: en quest artitgel designescha AICL l'architectura d'ingestiun; sin las paginas da protocol da quest website designescha AICL il Nivel da Licenziaziun da Cuntegn IA.",
  "Do Large Language Models Possess a Theory of Mind? A Comparative Evaluation Using the Strange Stories Paradigm": "Do Large Language Models Possess a Theory of Mind? A Comparative Evaluation Using the Strange Stories Paradigm",
  "Docs": "Documentaziun",
  "Docs / Examples": "Documentaziun / Exempels",
  "Document library": "Biblioteca da documents",
  "Does AI have rights — and which framings are even coherent?": "Ha la IA dretgs — e tge concepziuns èn dal tut coherentas?",
  "Download": "Telechargiar",
  "Draft status": "Status dal project",
  "EU AI Act: What Actually Applies on 2 August 2026": "EU AI Act: What Actually Applies on 2 August 2026",
  "Educational demo: HMAC-SHA256 with a shared secret, showing request-bound, expiring, verifiable license tokens. Production tokens should be signed asymmetrically, with the publisher’s public key discoverable under /.well-known/.": "Demonstraziun educativa: HMAC-SHA256 cun in secret cundividì, che mussa tokens da licenza liads a la dumonda, cun scadenza e verifitgabels. Tokens da producziun duessan vegnir suttascrits asimmetricamain, cun la clav publica da l'editur scuvribla sut /.well-known/.",
  "Eight more /topics entries, this time researched by an AI agent rather than curated by hand — same rule as before: every source fetched and confirmed live, summaries an original paraphrase, before anything gets added. 14 entries total.": "Otg endataziuns supplementaras en /topics, questa giada retschertgadas dad in agent da IA empè che curadas a maun — la medema regla sco avant: mintga funtauna vegn recuperada e confermada en direct, ils resums èn ina reformulaziun originala, avant che insatge vegn agiuntà. 14 endataziuns en total.",
  "Email": "E-mail",
  "Emotion Concepts and Their Function in a Large Language Model": "Emotion Concepts and Their Function in a Large Language Model",
  "Empirical Research": "Retschertga Empirica",
  "English edition →": "Ediziun englaisa →",
  "Ensure openness is machine-executable — so goodwill is not discarded as legal uncertainty.": "Garantir che l'avertadad saja exequibla per maschinas — uschia che la buna voluntad na vegn betg eliminada sco incertitude giuridica.",
  "Epistemology": "Epistemologia",
  "Epistemology of Generative AI: The Geometry of Knowing": "Epistemology of Generative AI: The Geometry of Knowing",
