  "Turns declared rights into executable licensing: quote, pay, verify, audit, revoke.": "Transferescha dretgs declarads en ina licenziaziun exequibla: offerta, pagament, verificaziun, revisiun, revocaziun.",
  "Twenty languages live in total: English, Traditional Chinese, Simplified Chinese, Japanese, Korean, French, German, Spanish, Portuguese, Russian, Arabic, Turkish, Persian, Bengali, Hindi, Indonesian, Vietnamese, Greek, Italian, Dutch.": "En total vainch lingas activas: englais, chinais tradiziunal, chinais simplifitgà, giapunais, corean, franzos, tudestg, spagnol, portugais, rus, arab, turc, persian, bengalais, hindi, indonesian, vietnamais, grec, talian, nederlandais.",
  "Two license tiers: a free public tier and a contact-based commercial tier.": "Duas categorias da licenza: ina categoria publica gratuita ed ina categoria commerziala basada sin contact.",
  "UI": "Interfatscha d'utilisader",
  "Undefined openness reads as legal uncertainty to AI pipelines and gets cleaned out; only protocolized, machine-readable permission makes content genuinely learnable.": "Ina avertadad betg definida vegn interpretada sco incertitude giuridica per process da IA e vegn eliminada; mo ina permissiun protocolisada e leschibla per maschinas rendia il cuntegn propi abel dad esser emprendì.",
  "Usage logs and audit trails": "Protocols dad utilisaziun e tragects da revisiun",
