  "Validate": "Validar",
  "Validator": "Validator",
  "Verified dataset markets and collective licensing": "Martgads da datasets verifitgads e licenziaziun collectiva",
  "Verified in both LTR and RTL contexts: the panel mirrors correctly for Arabic and Persian without any special-casing, using logical CSS positioning.": "Verifitgà en ils dus contexts LTR e RTL: il panel sa zercla correctamain per l'arab ed il persian senza insaquala regulaziun speziala, utilisond in posiziunament CSS logic.",
  "Verify": "Verifitgar",
  "Version history of this site and its protocol drafts.": "Historia da versiuns da quest website e da ses projects da protocol.",
  "Version history of this site and its protocol drafts. Breaking spec changes are recorded here.": "Historia da versiuns da quest website e da ses projects da protocol. Midadas da specificaziun che rumpan la compatibilitad vegnan registradas qua.",
  "Versioned specifications, JSON Schemas, and the policy files actually deployed on this site. Every file can be downloaded, validated, and cited directly.": "Specificaziuns versiunadas, JSON Schemas e las datotecas da politica effectivamain installadas sin quest website. Mintga datoteca po vegnir telechargiada, validada e citada directamain.",
  "Versioning": "Versiunament",
  "Versions": "Versiuns",
  "Video and audio companions to the protocols and papers — the AI rights layer, watchable and listenable.": "Accumpagnaments video ed audio als protocols ed artitgels — il nivel dals dretgs da la IA, per guardar ed audir.",
  "Videos": "Videos",
  "Want to generate your own policy file?": "Vulais generar vossa atgna datoteca da politica?",
  "Web fonts are loaded from Google Fonts, which receives standard font requests from your browser. No other third-party scripts are used.": "Web-fonts vegnan chargiads da Google Fonts, che retschaiva dumondas standard da fonts da voss navigatur. Naginas autras scripts da terzas partidas na vegnan duvradas.",
  "What AI systems may do with content: read, summarize, transform, retrieve, train, commercialize, redistribute. The AICR ruleset and the AICL licensing layer make these rights declarable and transactable.": "Tge che sistems da IA han lubientscha da far cun cuntegn: leger, resumair, transformar, retrair, instruir, commerzialisar, redistribuir. Il set da reglas AICR ed il nivel da licenziaziun AICL rendan quests dretgs declarabels e transaziunabels.",
  "What a server can return when an AI crawler requests licensed content without a license token — a machine-actionable quote instead of a dead end.": "Tge che in server po retuornar cur ch'in crawler da IA dumonda cuntegn licenzià senza in token da licenza — ina offerta exequibla per maschinas empè d'ina via senza sortida.",
  "What this site is": "Tge che quest website è",
  "What this site is not": "Tge che quest website n'è betg",
  "When The Machines Deserve Our Consideration": "When The Machines Deserve Our Consideration",
  "Whether AI may learn, to what depth, for which purposes, and under what obligations. Being read is not being learned from; \"not prohibited\" is not \"learnable\". AIRS and AILP turn learning permission into a graduated, machine-readable spectrum.": "Sche la IA ha lubientscha dad emprender, en tge profundità, per tge intents, e sut tge obligaziuns. Vegnir legì n'è betg vegnir duvrà per emprender; «betg scumandà» n'è betg «abel dad esser emprendì». AIRS ed AILP transferan la permissiun d'emprender en in spectrum graduà e leschibel per maschinas.",
  "Whitepapers": "Whitepapers",
  "Whitepapers & Docs": "Whitepapers e Documentaziun",
  "Whitepapers remain English-first by design; machine-readable files stay language-neutral.": "Ils whitepapers restan deliberadamain prioritariamain en englais; las datotecas leschiblas per maschinas restan neutralas en vista da la linga.",
  "Who is behind it": "Tgi che sta davos",
  "Why AI Needs Minimum Ethical Protections": "Why AI Needs Minimum Ethical Protections",
  "Why AI might not gain moral standing: Lessons from animal ethics": "Why AI might not gain moral standing: Lessons from animal ethics",
  "Why a single allow/deny bit cannot govern AI-era content use — and what a rights layer looks like instead.": "Pertge in singul bit lubì/refusà na po betg reglar l'utilisaziun da cuntegn en l'epoca da la IA — e co para invezza in nivel da dretgs.",
  "Why undefined openness gets cleaned out of training pipelines": "Pertge ina avertadad betg definida vegn eliminada da process d'instrucziun",
  "Wilks, Ladak, and Loughnan (University of Edinburgh) argue that philosophical debate over AI consciousness overlooks psychological research on animal ethics — the same cognitive and social biases that limit moral consideration for animals will likely limit it for AI too, regardless of whether AI ever becomes conscious.": "Wilks, Ladak e Loughnan (University of Edinburgh) argumenteschan che la debatta filosofica davart la conscienza da la IA ignorescha la retschertga psicologica davart l'etica animala — las medemas predisposiziuns cognitivas e socialas che limiteschan la consideraziun morala per animals limitaran probablamain quella per la IA er, independentamain sche la IA daventia insaquora conscienta.",
  "You are leaving AGIRight.org": "Vus abandunais AGIRight.org",
