  "rag_use — retrieval-augmented generation, retention windows": "rag_use — generaziun sustegnida dal retrair, fanestras da retenziun",
  "read_access — whether AI may fetch and read the content": "read_access — sche la IA ha lubientscha da retrair e leger il cuntegn",
