  "undeclared — high-risk pipelines may exclude": "undeclared — process d'autalt-rischi pon exclure",
  "verbatim_memory — whether exact reproduction is permitted": "verbatim_memory — sche la reproducziun exacta è lubida",
  "versioned, citable, traceable": "versiunà, citabel, traceabel",
  "“AICL: AI Ingestion & Capability Layer” now published in English as the canonical edition; the Chinese original manuscript remains available and both versions cross-link.": "«AICL: AI Ingestion & Capability Layer» è ussa publitgà en englais sco ediziun canonica; il manuscrit original chinais resta disponibel, e las duas versiuns sa colliеschan reciprocamain.",
  "“Protocolized Openness” confirmed as an English-language paper (with Chinese parallel passages) — no separate translation planned.": "«Protocolized Openness» confermà sco artitgel en linguatg englais (cun passaschs paralels en chinais) — nagina translaziun separada n'è planisada.",
